11. Códigos de Erro
401 missing_or_invalid_api_key
401 missing_or_invalid_wallet_id
403 wallet_id_mismatch
400 validation_error
422 processing_failed
409 idempotency_conflict
429 rate_limited
500 internal_error
12. SDKs Oficiais
Node.js / TypeScript — npm i @netshop/node
Python — pip install netshop
PHP — composer require netshop/netshop-php
Java — com.netshop:netshop-java:1.x
Plugins prontos: WooCommerce e WHMCS. Para Shopify use o guia NetShop + Shopify (Custom Payment).
